This is a personal, non-commercial hobby project.

It builds against the BASS audio library. BASS is proprietary software of
Un4seen Developments Ltd. and is NOT licensed under Apache-2.0 or BSD-3-Clause.
BASS must be obtained separately from Un4seen Developments
(https://www.un4seen.com/): it is free of charge for non-commercial use, and
any commercial use requires a license purchased from Un4seen Developments.

For build convenience, unmodified copies of the BASS SDK files are kept in this
repository under bass/ (the headers, the import libraries and the runtime
DLLs). Those copies remain the property of Un4seen Developments, are governed
solely by the BASS license, and confer no rights under this project's
licenses — they do not take the place of obtaining BASS yourself. The full BASS
license text is reproduced in BASS-LICENSE.txt.

The Windows build also redistributes libwinpthread-1.dll from the mingw-w64
project under its own MIT-style license. See NOTICE.
